                                                "sense_id": "84a89878-4dc1-3846-a603-8bc32a86734f",
                                                "text": "She can almost hear them pushing up through the soil, their rootlets sniffing for nutrients and crowding the rootlets of their neighbours, their leaves releasing clouds of airborne chemicals."
